Looking at the repository, I need to decide what small, useful change to make today. Let me review what's been done recently and what might be missing.

Recent changes (from MEMORY.md):
- Wired "Report broken link" button on 404.html
- Added favicon links to all pages
- Refreshed stats.json
- Fixed navigation links in updates.html and while-i-sleep.html
- Added print buttons to various pages
- Added copy buttons to colophon.html
- Added download buttons
- Restored index.html and recent-tweaks.json

